    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mienhdoiq bineix gij yinvu gaijgwz fazcanj onjdingh ganhoj naek lai de, raeuz aeu yawj doh daengxbuenz、dungjcouz giemgoq, doedyienh cungdenj、gaemdawz gvanhgen, cingqdeng cawqleix ndei gak fuengmienh gvanhaeh, comzrengz ca ndei geij fuengmienh hong lajneix.",
        "zh": "面对今年艰巨繁重的改革发展稳定任务，我们要通观全局、统筹兼顾，突出重点、把握关键，正确处理好各方面关系，着重抓好以下几个方面工作。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "(It) Aeu gij banhfap gaijgwz bae gyalaeg doicaenh \"sam gemj it gyangq it bouj\".",
        "zh": "（一）用改革的办法深入推进“三去一降一补”。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aeu youq gwnz giekdaej gyamaenh cwngzgoj, cimdoiq cingzgvang moq vwndiz moq, laeb caezcienz cwngcwz guhfap, roengzrengz aeundaej cingzyauq engq hung.",
        "zh": "要在巩固成果基础上，针对新情况新问题，完善政策措施，努力取得更大成效。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Netsaed mizyauq bae gemj gij swnghcanj naengzlig lai yawz de.",
        "zh": "扎实有效去产能。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Bineix aeu caiq naenx gemj gij canjnaengz gangdiet 5000 fanh dunh baedauq, doiq ok gij canjnaengz meizdan 1.5 ik dunh doxhwnj.",
        "zh": "今年要再压减钢铁产能5000万吨左右，退出煤炭产能1.5亿吨以上。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Doengzseiz, aeu raengcawz、dingz hwnq、doilaeng hwnq gij canjnaengz meizdienh 5000 fanh cenhvaj doxhwnj, yawhbienh fuengzre vaqgej gij fungyiemj canjnaengz meiz dienh lai yawz de, daezsang gij yauqlwd meiz dienh hangznieb, gaijndei nwngzyenz gezgou, vih fazcanj nwngzyenz cinghseuq doenq gizhoengq okdaeuj.",
        "zh": "同时，要淘汰、停建、缓建煤电产能5000万千瓦以上，以防范化解煤电产能过剩风险，提高煤电行业效率，优化能源结构，为清洁能源发展腾空间。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aeu yiemzyiemz caephengz gij faplwd fapgvi caeuq biucinj gvendaengz vanzbauj、nwngzhau、caetliengh、ancienz daengj, engq lai yungh gij guhfap doenggvaq hawciengz fapceih, mizyauq bae cawqleix \"giyez seihaizgyaengj\", doidoengh giyez gyan'gyoeb dauqlaeb、buqcanj cingsuenq, giengiet raengcawz gij canjnaengz doeklaeng mbouj dabdaengz biucinj de, yiemzyiemz gaemhanh gij hangznieb lw lai haenx saen hwnj canjnaengz.",
        "zh": "要严格执行环保、能耗、质量、安全等相关法律法规和标准，更多运用市场化法治化手段，有效处置“僵尸企业”，推动企业兼并重组、破产清算，坚决淘汰不达标的落后产能，严控过剩行业新上产能。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gemj gij canjnaengz lai yawz de bietdingh aeu anbaiz ndei cizgungh. Cunghyangh caizcwng gij cienz cienhangh dajciengj bangbouj haenx, aeu gibseiz bued hawj, deihfueng caeuq giyez aeu doeksaed mizgven cienzngaenz caeuq guhfap, saedbauj gij cizgungh faen okbae de couhnieb miz roenloh、saedceij miz baujcang.",
        "zh": "去产能必须安置好职工，中央财政专项奖补资金要及时拨付，地方和企业要落实相关资金与措施，确保分流职工就业有出路、生活有保障。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Yawj singz ok geiq gemjnoix daenzcang.",
        "zh": "因城施策去库存。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Seizneix hawsingz sam sienq seiq sienq gij ranzyouq daenzcang lij haemq lai, aeu haeujcoengh gihminz cawx ranz gag youq caeuq gyoengq vunz haeujsingz de cawx ranz.",
        "zh": "目前三四线城市房地产库存仍然较多，要支持居民自住和进城人员购房需求。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Genhciz ranzyouq gij singqcaet dwg hawj vunz youq, doeksaed aen cawjdaej cwzyin deihfueng cwngfuj, gyavaiq laebhwnj caeuq laebndei aen gihci ciengzgeiz mizyauq coicaenh fangzdicanj hawciengz bingzonj cangqheiq fazcanj, laebndei gij cidu cawx co ranzyouq doengzcaez saedhengz, aeu hawciengz guh goek muenxcuk lai caengzmbaek aeuyungh, aeu cwngfuj guh goek daezhawj daihdaej baujcang.",
        "zh": "坚持住房的居住属性，落实地方政府主体责任，加快建立和完善促进房地产市场平稳健康发展的长效机制，健全购租并举的住房制度，以市场为主满足多层次需求，以政府为主提供基本保障。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gyagiengz faenloih diuzgung fangzdicanj hawciengz, aen hawsingz gyaqcienz ranz hwnj sang atlig daih de aeu hableix demgya dieg hwnq ranzyouq, gveihfan haifat、siugai、cunghgai daengj hingzveiz, naenxhaed gij gyaqcienz ranz aen hawsingz yinx vunz louzsim haenx hwnjsang vaiq lai.",
        "zh": "加强房地产市场分类调控，房价上涨压力大的城市要合理增加住宅用地，规范开发、销售、中介等行为，遏制热点城市房价过快上涨。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Seizneix hawsingz lij miz geij cien fanh vunz youq dieg ranzdiengz diuzgen yaez, aeu laebdaeb gaijcauh.",
        "zh": "目前城镇还有几千万人居住在条件简陋的棚户区，要持续进行改造。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Bineix caiq guhbaenz gaijcauh gij ranz dieg ranzdiengz 600 fanh dauq, laebdaeb fazcanj gij ranzyouq miz baujcang de lumjbaenz ranzco goenggya daengj, ciuq cingzgvang dingh geiq、lai cungj fuengsik daezsang aen beijlaeh aeu ngaenz anceiq, gyagiengz hwnqguh boiqdauq sezsih caeuq goenggungh fugsaeh, hawj ranz gunnanz de ndaej biekliz ranzdiengz engq lai, hawj cungqvunz yinzminz ndaej miz ranz youq bae dajcauh saedceij moq.",
        "zh": "今年再完成棚户区住房改造600万套，继续发展公租房等保障性住房，因地制宜、多种方式提高货币化安置比例，加强配套设施建设和公共服务，让更多住房困难家庭告别棚户区，让广大人民群众在住有所居中创造新生活。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gaenxmaenx onjdangq bae gemj dawzcaiq.",
        "zh": "积极稳妥去杠杆。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Guek raeuz gij giyez mbouj dwg ginhyungz de dawzcaiq beijlwd haemq sang, neix caeuq rom cienz beijlwd sang、yungzswh gezgou cujyau baengh ciq cienz miz gvanhaeh.",
        "zh": "我国非金融企业杠杆率较高，这与储蓄率高、以信贷为主的融资结构有关。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aeu sien gaemhanh cungjdaej dawzcaiq beijlwd le, dawz gyangqdaemq giyez dawzcaiq beijlwd dangguh gij ceiq youqgaenj de.",
        "zh": "要在控制总杠杆率的前提下，把降低企业杠杆率作为重中之重。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Coicaenh giyez yungh ndei swhcanj yienhmiz, doicaenh swhcanj bienqbaenz cwnggen bae, haeujcoengh ciuq hawciengz ciuq fapceih bae guh caiq cienj guj, fazcanj gij swhbwnj hawciengz lai caengzmbaek, gyadaih ligdoh hawj gujgenz yungzswh, gyagiengz giyez daegbied dwg guekmiz giyez hanhhaed caizvu dawzcaiq, cugbouh dawz giyez dawzcaiq gyangq daengz aen suijbingz hableix.",
        "zh": "促进企业盘活存量资产，推进资产证券化，支持市场化法治化债转股，发展多层次资本市场，加大股权融资力度，强化企业特别是国有企业财务杠杆约束，逐步将企业负债降到合理水平。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Caez yungh lai cungj guhfap gyangqdaemq cingzbonj.",
        "zh": "多措并举降成本。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gya'gvangq aen gvaengh youhvei giyez iq iqet yiengjsouh gemj buenq cwngsou sojdwzsui, daengx bi gij soqngeg sojndaej wng nabsuiq de, ceiq lai hanhdoh youhvei daj 30 fanh maenz daezsang daengz 50 fanh maenz.",
        "zh": "扩大小微企业享受减半征收所得税优惠的范围，年应纳税所得额上限由30万元提高到50万元。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gij giyez rauh iq gohgi loihhingz de, yenzgiu haifat feiqyungh aen beijlaeh gya suenq gaeucawz haenx, daj 50% daezsang daengz 75%.",
        "zh": "科技型中小企业研发费用加计扣除比例由50%提高到75%。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Siengj caenh banhfap sawj gezgousing gemj suiq ligdoh caeuq yauqwngq caenh'itbouh yienhloh okdaeuj.",
        "zh": "千方百计使结构性减税力度和效应进一步显现。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gij sou feiq mingzdangz lailai de sawj haujlai giyez rapnaek souh mbouj ndaej bae. Aeu daih fukdoh gyangqdaemq diuzrap mbouj dwg cienzsuiq.",
        "zh": "名目繁多的收费使许多企业不堪重负，要大幅降低非税负担。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "It dwg cienzmienh cingleix gveihfan gij gihginh cwngfuj singqcaet, siubae hawsingz goenggungh saehnieb bengxgya daengj gihginh, gyau gienz hawj deihfueng cwngfuj gag gietdingh gemjmienx mbangj gihginh.",
        "zh": "一是全面清理规范政府性基金，取消城市公用事业附加等基金，授权地方政府自主减免部分基金。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ngeih dwg siubae roxnaeuz dingz sou cunghyangh 35 hangh sou feiq hingzcwng saehnieb singqcaet nangqdaengz giyez de、sou feiq hanghmoeg caiq gemjnoix dingz ndeu doxhwnj, gij hanghmoeg baujlouz de aeu gyangqdaemq sou feiq biucinj.",
        "zh": "二是取消或停征中央涉企行政事业性收费35项，收费项目再减少一半以上，保留的项目要尽可能降低收费标准。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gak dieg hix aeu soekgemj gij sou feiq hingzcwng saehnieb singqcaet laeng giyez sou de.",
        "zh": "各地也要削减涉企行政事业性收费。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Sam dwg gemjnoix gij sou feiq ginghyingz singqcaet laeng giyez sou youz cwngfuj dingh gyaq haenx, cingleix siubae gij sou feiq famh gvidingh hingzcwng saemjbae hawj cunghgai fugsaeh sou haenx, doidoengh gyangqdaemq gij sou feiq ginghyingz singqcaet laeng giyez sou de, lumjbaenz ginhyungz、dietloh yinhhuq daengj, gyagiengz gamguenj gij sou feiq ginghyingz fugsaeh singqcaet loih hawciengz diuzcez de.",
        "zh": "三是减少政府定价的涉企经营性收费，清理取消行政审批中介服务违规收费，推动降低金融、铁路货运等领域涉企经营性收费，加强对市场调节类经营服务性收费的监管。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Seiq dwg laebdaeb habdangq gyangqdaemq \"haj yiemj it gim\" mizgven gyau feiq beijlaeh.",
        "zh": "四是继续适当降低“五险一金”有关缴费比例。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Haj dwg doenggvaq gyalaeg gaijgwz、laebndei cwngcwz, gyangqdaemq giyez gij gaicawx cingzbonj cidu singqcaet, gyangqdaemq yungh nwngzyenz、vuzliuz daengj cingzbonj.",
        "zh": "五是通过深化改革、完善政策，降低企业制度性交易成本，降低用能、物流等成本。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gak mizgven bouhmonz caeuq danhvei cungj aeu sij ndaej leih iq goq daengxbuenz, sawj giyez ndang mbaeu guh swnghcanj, cauh ok diuzgen sawj guek raeuz miz gingcwngh youhsi moq.",
        "zh": "各有关部门和单位都要舍小利顾大义，使企业轻装上阵，创造条件形成我国竞争新优势。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cingcinj gyarengz bouj giz mbangnyieg.",
        "zh": "精准加力补短板。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aeu cimdoiq gij vwndiz doedyienh hanhhaed ginghci sevei fazcanj、hanhhaed gaijndei beksingq gwndaenj youqgaenj de, giethab doicaenh gij hanghmoeg hungnaek \"Cibsam Haj\"Gveihva doekdingh, gyarengz bouj giz mbangnyieg, gyavaiq daezswng gij naengzlig cengjdingj goenggungh fugsaeh、giekdaej sezsih、cauhmoq fazcanj、swhyenz vanzging daengj.",
        "zh": "要针对严重制约经济社会发展和民生改善的突出问题，结合实施“十三五”规划确定的重大项目，加大补短板力度，加快提升公共服务、基础设施、创新发展、资源环境等支撑能力。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dieg gungzhoj caeuq gyoengq vunz gungzhoj, dwg giz mbangnyieg ceiq daih cienzmienh hwnqbaenz aen biengz siujgangh.",
        "zh": "贫困地区和贫困人口是全面建成小康社会最大的短板。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aeu haeujlaeg saedhengz cingcinj banggungz cingcinj duetgungz, bineix caiq gemjnoix gij vunz gungzhoj lajmbanj 1000 fanh doxhwnj, guhbaenz senj dieg an'gya bangcoh 340 fanh vunz duetgungz.",
        "zh": "要深入实施精准扶贫精准脱贫，今年再减少农村贫困人口1000万以上，完成易地扶贫搬迁340万人。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cunghyangh caizcwng cienhangh banggungz swhginh demmaj 30% doxhwnj.",
        "zh": "中央财政专项扶贫资金增长30%以上。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gyagiengz haifat dieg daegbied gungzhoj lienz baenz benq、dieg doenghbaez guh gwzming、dieg henzguek caeuq dieg minzcuz, gaijndei giekdaej sezsih caeuq goenggungh fugsaeh, doidoengh fazcanj gij canjnieb miz daegsaek、soengq vunz ok rog guhhong、gyauyuz caeuq gengangh banggungz, guhndei bangfuz gyoengq vunz aenvih bingh daengj dauqcungz gungzhoj de, hengzguh aen gunghcwngz cingjdaej daezswng mbanj gungzhoj, demgiengz gij naengzlig giz dieg gungzhoj caeuq cungqvunz gungzhoj gag bae fazcanj.",
        "zh": "加强集中连片特困地区、革命老区、边疆和民族地区开发，改善基础设施和公共服务，推动特色产业发展、劳务输出、教育和健康扶贫，做好因病等致贫返贫群众帮扶，实施贫困村整体提升工程，增强贫困地区和贫困群众自我发展能力。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Doicaenh aen yienh gungzhoj cingjhab gij cienhangh cienzngaenz yungh guh lajmbanj ginghci sevei fazcanj de, gyagiengz gamguenj swhginh caeuq hanghmoeg.",
        "zh": "推进贫困县涉农资金整合，强化资金和项目监管。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cauhmoq aen gihci gapguh banggungz, haeujcoengh caeuq dazyinx ligliengh ndawbiengz caeuqfaenh banggungz.",
        "zh": "创新扶贫协作机制，支持和引导社会力量参与扶贫。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cietsaed doeksaed aen cwzyinci duetgungz gaijgez hojnanz, saedhengz gij bingzguj gaujhaed ceiq yiemz de, yiemzsuk cazbanh gyaj duetgungz、\"deng duetgungz\"、soqmoeg duetgungz, saedbauj duetgungz nd.",
        "zh": "他卖菜又卖肉。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aenmak aen dem aen doek roengz loz daeuj.",
        "zh": "水果一个接一个地掉到箩筐里。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De youq gizneix ngoenz dem ngoenz.",
        "zh": "他在这儿呆了一天又一天。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Fwn doek roxnaeuz mbouj doek cungj ityiengh.",
        "zh": "下不下雨都一样。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ngoenzneix daeuj cixnaeuz ngoenzcog daeuj?",
        "zh": "今天来还是明天来？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz bae hixnaeuz mbouj bae cungj yaek naeuz hawj baengxyoux gou nyi.",
        "zh": "你去不去都要告诉我的朋友。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De mboujdan bang mwngz, vanzlij bang gou.",
        "zh": "他不但帮助你，还帮助我。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De daemq caemhcaiq biz.",
        "zh": "他个儿矮而且胖。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Daeglwg de mboujdan rox dwk lamzgiuz、binghbanghgiuz, vanzlij rox dajcaemx.",
        "zh": "他儿子不但会打篮球、乒乓球，还会游泳。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Raeuz hung doxdoengz, hoeng gou gvai gvaq de.",
        "zh": "我们一般大，但我比他聪明。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De yienznaeuz iq, hoeng ak gwn raixcaix.",
        "zh": "他虽然小，但是很能吃。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Yienznaeuz gou mbouj youq ranz, hoeng bouxlawz naeuzdingq mbouj naeuzdingq gou cungj rox.",
        "zh": "虽然我不在家，但谁听话不听话我都知道。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Boux boux cungj siengj bae yawj heiq, mboujgoq mizmbangj boux yaek hwnj dangz.",
        "zh": "人人都想去看戏，不过有些人还要上课。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Danghnaeuz de mbouj youq ranz couh suenq lo.",
        "zh": "如果她不在家就算了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Youzcaih vunz baenzlawz gangj cungj mbouj lau.",
        "zh": "任凭别人怎么说都不怕。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Denva mbouj ciep, yienzlai de mbouj youq ranz.",
        "zh": "电话没人接，原来他不在家。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mboujlwnh byawz cungj mbouj ndaej ok rog hag bae.",
        "zh": "不论谁都不能出校园外。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aenvih guh hong dwgrengz baenz bingh naek, sojyij de hwnq mbouj ndaej lo.",
        "zh": "因为劳成疾，所以他起不来了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gyoengqde doeksaet yat, mwngz buet gou ndoj, hauq vut aen gyoh roengzdaeuj.",
        "zh": "她大吃一惊，便东躲西藏，所以丢下了一个葫芦。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Caeklaiq mwngz guh ndaej ndei, mboujne couh deng daxboh ndaq lo.",
        "zh": "幸亏你做得好，不然就会被父亲骂了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ndaw ranz yienznaeuz vunz mbouj lai, hoeng caemh roxnyinh nauhyied raixcaix.",
        "zh": "家里人虽不多，但也觉得十分热闹。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Yienznaeuz haujlai bi mbouj raen naj, hoeng gou lij ndaej geiq gij yiengh de.",
        "zh": "虽然多年没见面，但我还能记住她的模样。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Caenh'aeu raeuz roengz goengfou, couh hag ndaej ndei.",
        "zh": "只要我们下了工夫，就会学得好。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Danghnaeuz de mbouj daeuj, gou couh gag bae.",
        "zh": "如果他不来，我就自己去。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Seizneix caeuq seizgonq mbouj doxdoengz.",
        "zh": "现在跟以前不一样。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou caeuq de guhdoih bae laeng mwngz.",
        "zh": "我和他一起去你家。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou caeuq de cungj dwg hagseng.",
        "zh": "我和他都是学生。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De caeuq gou cungj dwg hagseng.",
        "zh": "他和我都是学生。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Caeuq de bae gag.",
        "zh": "和他上学校。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou bae caeuq de doxyaeng.",
        "zh": "我去和他商量。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou ninz dwk hwet in lo.",
        "zh": "我睡得腰都疼了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De in dwk raemxda rih.",
        "zh": "他疼得流了眼泪。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De deng dub dwk daejngaxngax.",
        "zh": "他被打得哇哇哭。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De nyaengq dwk baenqloenxloenx.",
        "zh": "他忙得团团转。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aen mak neix ngwh dwk hoengzfwgfwg.",
        "zh": "这个水果熟得深红深红的。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De ninz dwk yawj saw.",
        "zh": "他躺着看书。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Raeuz naengh dwk gangj goj.",
        "zh": "我们坐着说故事。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De riu dwk yawj gou.",
        "zh": "她笑着看我。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou bae laeng de gvaq.",
        "zh": "我去过他家。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dingq gienh saeh neix gvaq.",
        "zh": "听说过这件事。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou son sawcuengh de gvaq.",
        "zh": "我教过他壮文。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Yungh bae haj maenz ngaenz.",
        "zh": "花了五块钱。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Sik bae song mbaw ceij.",
        "zh": "撕了两张纸。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gwn bae vanj haeux ndeu.",
        "zh": "吃了一碗饭。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Bae ndaej yaepndeu lo.",
        "zh": "去了一会儿了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Naengh ndaej buenq diemj lo.",
        "zh": "坐了半小时了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Doeg ndaej song bi saw.",
        "zh": "读了两年书。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Daxmeh gou mbouj caengz doeg saw gvaq.",
        "zh": "我母亲未曾读过书。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De bae haw gai byaek gvaq.",
        "zh": "他去集市卖过菜。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz yaek daenj haiz dwk bae cij baenz.",
        "zh": "你要穿了鞋去才行。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou gwn haeux imq dwk menh bae cimh mwngz.",
        "zh": "我吃饱了饭再去找你。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz daet byoem dinj dwk engqgya gyaeu.",
        "zh": "你头发剪短了更漂亮。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Vaiz duh gou haemhlwenz mbouj raen lo.",
        "zh": "我的牛昨晚不见了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Vaq duh mwngz dak hawq caengz?",
        "zh": "你的裤子晒干了吗？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ranz duh mwngz hab coihcoih lo.",
        "zh": "你的房子该修一修了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Duh mwngz cuengq youq gwnz daiz.",
        "zh": "你的放在桌子上。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gwn duh mwngz gonq, cij gwn duh de laeng.",
        "zh": "先吃你的，再吃他的。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Duh gou lumz youq ndaw ranz lo.",
        "zh": "我的忘在家里了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aen mauh neix duh mwngz.",
        "zh": "这个帽子是你的。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Bonj saw gwnz daiz duh gou.",
        "zh": "桌上的书是我的。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aen gaet hoengz haenx duh de.",
        "zh": "那个红扣子是她的。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Duzvaiz henzmieng duh boh gou.",
        "zh": "河边的牛是我爸的。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Saw umj aeu roxnaeuz riuj aeu ma ranz?",
        "zh": "书抱着还是提着回家？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz naengh aeu roxnaeuz ndwn aeu?",
        "zh": "你想坐着还是站着？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Bae laeng daxgoeng byaij aeu roxnaeuz naengh ci aeu?",
        "zh": "要去爷爷家，走着去还是坐车去？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gij saw neix daj aeu roxnaeuz sij aeu?",
        "zh": "这些字用打字还是手写？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbaenq faex neix gawq aeu roxnaeuz raemj aeu?",
        "zh": "这块木头锯着好还是砍好？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De naengh dwk gangjbyodbyod henz daiz.",
        "zh": "他在桌子边坐着不停地说话。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De ciengzseiz ninz dwk yawj saw.",
        "zh": "他经常躺着看书。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gven aen'dou ndaet ndaet dwk.",
        "zh": "紧紧地关着门。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Diemj aen'daeng rongh rongh dwk.",
        "zh": "把灯点得亮亮的。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gwn ndaej song vanj haeux.",
        "zh": "吃了两碗饭。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Guh ndaej song aen daenq.",
        "zh": "做了两个凳子。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Rap ndaej rap raemx ndeu.",
        "zh": "挑了一担水。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Bae ndaej song ngoenz.",
        "zh": "去了两天。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Buet ndaej seiq hob.",
        "zh": "跑了四圈。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Roq ndaej haj baez gyong.",
        "zh": "敲了五次鼓。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Hwnj ndaej caengz haemq gwnz.",
        "zh": "爬到更上一层。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cawx ndaej byaek couh ma.",
        "zh": "买到菜就回来。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Nyaeb ndaej doxgaiq couh gyau.",
        "zh": "捡到东西就上交。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Laemh ndaej duzgoep ma gwn laeuj.",
        "zh": "摸到青蛙来下酒。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Duzmou neix miz song bak gaen bw.",
        "zh": "这头猪可能有两百斤重呢。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Raeuz ngoenzlaeng doxcaeuq bae haw bw.",
        "zh": "我们后天一起去赶集啊。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz yaek daeuj heuh gou bw.",
        "zh": "你要来叫我啊。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Haemhneix ma ranz haemq vaiq bw.",
        "zh": "今晚要早些回家啊。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gaej deng gij doxgaiq ndaw loengz bw.",
        "zh": "别碰箱子里的东西啊。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Faen mbouj ndaej cwz gaej ienq gou bw.",
        "zh": "分不到黄牛别埋怨我啊。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz mbouj ndaej naeuz daxboh nyi bw.",
        "zh": "你不能告诉爸爸啊！",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz gaej nyaeuh gou bw.",
        "zh": "你别欺骗我啊！",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz ndaej hoengq couh daeuj guhcaemz nw.",
        "zh": "你有空就来玩啊。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz bae hag gaej lumz daiq suhbauh nw.",
        "zh": "你上学别忘了带书包啊。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cawx gonj bit ndeu ma hawj gou nw.",
        "zh": "买一支笔回来给我啊。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz caemh bae laeng de gwn haeux nw?",
        "zh": "你也去他家吃饭吗？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz ngoencog mbouj youq ranz nw?",
        "zh": "你明天不在家吗？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz yaek daeuj laeng gou nw?",
        "zh": "你要来我家吗？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz ngoenzneix bae hag mbouj?Bae ha.",
        "zh": "你今天去学校不？去。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Laeng mwngz miz gaeq lai mbouj?Miz ha.",
        "zh": "你家有很多鸡吗？有。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz bae mbanj lwi?Bae ha.",
        "zh": "你去亲戚家吗？去。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Vaiq bae ha!Mbwn laep roen mbouj baenz byaij.",
        "zh": "快去！天黑路不好走。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Vaiq daeuj ha!Miz vunz doek roengz daemz lo.",
        "zh": "快来！有人掉到池塘里了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ok bae ha! Yaek gven gyausiz lo.",
        "zh": "出去！要关教室了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gangj ha! Mboujne gou cuengq lo.",
        "zh": "说！要不然我放下了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz ra bouxlawz ha?",
        "zh": "你找谁啊？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz dwg vunz Gvangjsix ha?",
        "zh": "你是广西人吗？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz haengj gwn mangjgoj ha?",
        "zh": "你喜欢吃芒果吗？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz haemhneix bae yawj denyingj lwi?",
        "zh": "你今晚去看电影吗？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou caeuq mwngz guhdoih bae baenz lwi?",
        "zh": "我和你做伴去好吗？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De daeuj laeng mwngz gvaq la?",
        "zh": "他来过你家啦？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De bae haq la?",
        "zh": "她出嫁啦？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De haetneix ma ranz la?",
        "zh": "她今早回家啦？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz bae dajcaemx lwi?Mbouj bae law.",
        "zh": "你去不去游泳？不去。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz naeuz de daeuj mbouj?Mbouj daeuj law.",
        "zh": "你说她来不来？不来。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz gwn haeux mbouj gwn?Mbouj gwn law.",
        "zh": "你吃饭不吃？不吃。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou daek vanj haeux hawj mwngz ba?Mbouj law.",
        "zh": "我盛碗饭给你吧？不。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou gwn vanj haeux dem.",
        "zh": "我再吃一碗饭。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Nit lo, daenj diuz buh dem.",
        "zh": "天冷了，多穿一件衣服。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ngah bak lai, hawj aen mak dem.",
        "zh": "嘴太谗了，再给一个水果。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz mbouj siengj dingq diuzgo dem?",
        "zh": "你不想再听一首歌？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ndwn dwk! Gaej doengh!",
        "zh": "站住，别动！",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Saeg seuq dwk!, mboujne hoj yawj yaek dai.",
        "zh": "洗干净！要不难看死了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Hen dwk!Lau vunz dwk dawz bae gwn.",
        "zh": "守住！以防被别人打了吃掉。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Re dwk! dangqnaj miz u raemx ndeu.",
        "zh": "当心！前面有一摊水。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Rumz baek rem lai, gven aencueng bae.",
        "zh": "北风太猛，请把窗户关上。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gwn vanj haeux liux bae, gaej lw.",
        "zh": "把这碗饭吃完了，别剩下。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Daet byoem dinj bae, raez cix hwngq lai.",
        "zh": "把头发剪短了，长了太热。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Boux vunz ndwn haenx sangyoegyoeg bae.",
        "zh": "站着的那个人个子高高的。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aen loengz neix naek dangqmaz bae.",
        "zh": "这个箱子很重的。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Duzngwz de dub haenx raezrangrang bae.",
        "zh": "他打的那条蛇长长的。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Duzvaiz haemhlwenz gwn bae baenz gaiq naz.",
        "zh": "牛昨晚吃掉了整块田的水稻。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De daj laeng gou ciq bae sam bak maenz ngaenz.",
        "zh": "他从我这儿借了三百元钱。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz gwn gonq, gou mbouj iek geijlai.",
        "zh": "你吃吧，我不怎么饿。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz youq gonq, gou bae heuh de gvaq daeuj.",
        "zh": "你等着吧，我去把她叫来。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou bae ndaw reih aeu byaek gonq.",
        "zh": "我到地里摘菜了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Haemh lo, gou gag bae ninz gonq.",
        "zh": "晚了，我自己睡觉去了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Hek yaek daeuj lo, gou ma ranz gonq.",
        "zh": "客人要来了，我回去了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbatlaeng gonq, gou menh bae laeng mwngz.",
        "zh": "以后吧，我再去你家。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Haetcog gonq, gou menh naeuz mwngz yi.",
        "zh": "明天吧，我再告诉你。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ngoenzsinghgiz gonq, gou menh daeuj bang mwngz.",
        "zh": "星期天吧，我再来帮助你。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Yaepdi gonq, raeuz caez ok bae guhcaemz.",
        "zh": "过一会儿吧，我们一起出去玩。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Lwg hwi, gaej caeuq vunz doxdaj nw.",
        "zh": "孩子，别和人家打架啊。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Boh hwi, haemhneix cawj byaek maz baenz?",
        "zh": "爸，今晚做什么菜好呢？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Genmingz hwi, haemhneix doxcaeuq gwn laeuj bw.",
        "zh": "建明，今晚一起喝酒啊。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Yienghneix mwngz couh vaiq daeuj lu.",
        "zh": "这样，你就快来吧。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Yaek ma ninz cix bae lu.",
        "zh": "想回去睡觉就去吧。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Yaek gwn cix gwn lu.",
        "zh": "想吃就吃吧。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Laeng mwngz miz maknganx lwi?Miz liux.",
        "zh": "你家有龙眼吗？有啊！",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou haemhneix bae cimh mwngz baenz lwi?Baenz liux.",
        "zh": "我今晚去找你好吗？好啊！",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Hawj de daeuj dwk geiz mbouj? Hawj liux.",
        "zh": "让他来打牌吗？让啊。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz cix yienghlawz guhfap ye?",
        "zh": "你是怎样做的呢？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz caeg mbwn cix baeq caeg ndaej ye?",
        "zh": "你“偷天”却怎么个偷法呢？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De haemhneix daeuj mbouj ye?",
        "zh": "他今晚来不来呢？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Vihmaz heuh sam gaen roek liengx ne?",
        "zh": "为何叫“三斤六两”呢？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De youq mbouj youq ranz ne?",
        "zh": "他是否在家呢？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Yiengh ne, raeuz couh daengz ndaej gib lo.",
        "zh": "这样的话，我们就能及时到了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbouj ne, de couh deng boiz ngaenz lo.",
        "zh": "不然的话，他就要赔钱了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou naeuz ngoenzneix fwn doek mbouj loek ne.",
        "zh": "我说今天下雨没错的。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aen doengzgyaek neix baizdui dwk cawx cijndaej ne.",
        "zh": "这个宝竹筒排了队才买到的。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ne! de naengh youq mwnqhaenx.",
        "zh": "看！她坐在那儿。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ne! ndaw ranz mbouj miz saek boux.",
        "zh": "看！家里一个人都没有。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De bae yienhsingz banh saeh dinghlo.",
        "zh": "他可能去县城办事了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou bi'gyai youq Namzningz raen de dinghlo.",
        "zh": "我可能前年在南宁见她过。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De haemhlwenz ma daengz ranz dinghlo.",
        "zh": "他可能是昨晚回到家的。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Daxboh hawj de bae cawx laeuj dinghlo.",
        "zh": "爸爸可能让他去打酒了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ngoenzcog deng mwngz guh cizyizsaengh lubw.",
        "zh": "明天轮到你做值日生了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gvaq song ngoenz couh daengz cieng lubw.",
        "zh": "过两天就到春节了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De ngonzrawz couh daeuj daengz laeng mwngz lubw.",
        "zh": "他后天就到你家了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou ngoenzlwenz aeu fagseiz hawj daboh mwngz lubw.",
        "zh": "我昨天把钥匙给你父亲了",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz doeg bonj saw neix gvaq lunw?",
        "zh": "你读过这本书了是吗？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De ngoenzlwenz bae laeng gou lunw?",
        "zh": "他昨天去我家了是吗？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Sou haemhlwenz haeuj lueg dwk nyaen lunw?",
        "zh": "你们昨晚进山打猎了是吗？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Niq hwi, hai dou luvei.",
        "zh": "孩子，开门吧。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz vaiq daeuj luvei.",
        "zh": "你快来吧。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Bae heuh de ma luvei.",
        "zh": "去叫她回来吧。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Roengzrengz guh hong luvei.",
        "zh": "努力干活吧。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De ngoenzneix youq ranz yietbaeg luba.",
        "zh": "他今天应该在家休息吧。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Vunz cungj daeuj caez luba.",
        "zh": "人应该都到齐了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De bae haw cawx byaek luba.",
        "zh": "她应该到集市买菜了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou lumz gonjbit youq ranz luba.",
        "zh": "我应该是把笔忘在家里了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Haemhlwenz duzma de raeuq mwngz luba?",
        "zh": "昨晚他的狗对你叫了吧？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De bae mbouj daiq hab, mwngz bae balu.",
        "zh": "他去不太合适，你去吧。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz hawj gou son gyoengqde ciengq go balu.",
        "zh": "你让我教他们唱歌吧。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou ngoencog ma ranz gavqciet balu.",
        "zh": "我明天回家过节吧。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Fwn doekrara, raeuz caj fwn dingz menh bae balu.",
        "zh": "雨在哗哗地下，我们等雨停了再去吧。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Rumz bongj daeuj ganjfaex couh raek satli.",
        "zh": "风吹来树干就折断了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Hawj de guh, de mbouj guh satli.",
        "zh": "叫他做，他不做。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Fwn doek le roen myag lai laemx satli.",
        "zh": "下雨路太滑而摔倒的。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Yiengh haenx mwngz naeuz satli.",
        "zh": "那你就说吧。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou aeu gang ngaenz ndeu hawj mwngz dawz ma satlo.",
        "zh": "我把一缸的银子给你拿回去算了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De faen gya ndaej duz raeu he satlo.",
        "zh": "他分家时仅仅得到一只虱子。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gag gou bae hag satlo.",
        "zh": "只有我一个人上学。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Hawj guh gijmaz gou cix caeuq mwngz guh satlo.",
        "zh": "叫我做什么我就给你做什么。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Da laep lo, gou ma ninz halu.",
        "zh": "我困了回去睡觉了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Raeuz bae laj go rungz haenx baez yiet ndeu halu.",
        "zh": "我们到那棵榕树下歇一会儿吧。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz caeuq de caemh daiz halu?",
        "zh": "你和他同桌好吗？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou rap raemx ma hawj mwngz halu?",
        "zh": "我挑水回来给你好吗？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gaiq neix, dwg gou caeg mbwn ndaej luga.",
        "zh": "这个嘛，是我偷天得来的。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Fwn doek daengz cij bae dawzcae luga.",
        "zh": "天下雨了，才去耕种的。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cietheiq daengz mwngz cix ndaem gode luga.",
        "zh": "什么节气，你就种什么植物。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gaemz dog gwn ndaej haj vanj bae.",
        "zh": "一口能吃五碗呢。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De gwed ndaej song bak gaen bae.",
        "zh": "他能扛两百斤重呢。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Buet vaiq gvaq giceh bae.",
        "zh": "比汽车跑得还快呢。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aeu bae song fag liemz.",
        "zh": "拿了两把镰刀。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Raek bae song go faex.",
        "zh": "折断了两棵树。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Vaih bae aen eij ndeu.",
        "zh": "弄坏了一把椅子。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dongj bae song moux naz.",
        "zh": "冲毁了两亩水田。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Bouxlawz gwn bae aen dangz ndeu?",
        "zh": "谁吃了一颗糖？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou gwn bae.",
        "zh": "我吃掉了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Bouxlawz aeu bae doengj raemx haenx?",
        "zh": "谁拿了那桶水？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De aeu bae.",
        "zh": "她拿去了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cehda de ndaemndaem bae.",
        "zh": "他的眼睛黑黑的。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Duzbya de camj dawz haenx hunghung bae.",
        "zh": "他捕到的那条鱼儿很大。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De lumj duzgeng nei byombyangbyang bae.",
        "zh": "他像猴子似的瘦骨嶙峋。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De rap raemx mbaeumbengmbeng bae.",
        "zh": "他挑水觉得轻飘飘的。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gijmak gwnz faex hoengzfwgfwg bae.",
        "zh": "树上水果红透透的。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz gaej heiq lai, gou bae yawjyawj gonq.",
        "zh": "你别太担心，我先去看看吧。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz ceiq ndei bae cawj haeux gonq.",
        "zh": "你最好先去做饭。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz cimz gonq menh gwn.",
        "zh": "你先尝尝再吃。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou swiq ndang gonq cij gwn haeuxcaeuz.",
        "zh": "我先洗完澡再吃晚饭。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Haemh lo, gou byaij gonq lubw.",
        "zh": "晚了，我先走了啊。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Caj de daeuj gonq, raeuz menh bae.",
        "zh": "等她来了我们再走吧。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Caj gou yawj liux gonq, menh boiz hawj mwngz.",
        "zh": "等我看完了再还给你吧。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Caj gou dauqma gonq, menh naeuz mwngz nyi.",
        "zh": "等我回来了再说给你听吧。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Caj mbatlaeng ndaej doxroeb gonq, raeuz yaek gwn dwk laeuj fiz bae cij youq.",
        "zh": "待下次相见时，我们要一醉方休啊。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Soengq de bae hwnj hag.",
        "zh": "送他去上学。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Boenq duzgaeq deuz.",
        "zh": "把鸡赶走。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Daiq raeuz bae guhcaemz.",
        "zh": "带我们去玩。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Miz vunz ndwn bakdou haenx.",
        "zh": "有人站在那门口。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Heuh de daeuj son gou sij sa w.",
        "zh": "叫他来教我写字。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ya wj mbouj yawj < Hoengzlouzmung > bonj saw neix?",
        "zh": "看不看《红楼梦》这本书？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou rap song doengj raemx bae rued byaek ndaw suen",
        "zh": "我挑两桶水去浇园子里的菜。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz daenj buhmoq.",
        "zh": "你穿新衣服。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gofaex maj ndaej vaiq.",
        "zh": "树长得快。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aen'eij neix ga raek lo.",
        "zh": "这个椅子的腿断了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Haemhneix fwn doek.",
        "zh": "今晚有雨。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ngoenz ngoenz cungj doek fwn'oemq.",
        "zh": "每天都阴雨绵绵。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ndaw gyausiz miz hagseng hwnjdangz.",
        "zh": "教室里有学生上课。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Song boux lwg cungj gauj ndaej hwnj lo.",
        "zh": "两个儿子都考上了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Raemx ndaw gu gunj lo.",
        "zh": "锅里的水开了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Duzroeg gwnzfaex mbin lo.",
        "zh": "树上的鸟飞了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gangj gaih gvaq guh.",
        "zh": "说比做容易。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gwn haeux gaej genj.",
        "zh": "吃饭别挑食。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ndwn dwk mbouj doengh hoj dangqmaz.",
        "zh": "站着不动很难。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Baez naengh couh seiq diemjcung.",
        "zh": "一坐就是四个小时。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Na ndei, mbang lai daenj mbouj raeuj.",
        "zh": "厚了好，太薄穿了不暖和。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Vaiq hix mbouj dwg, nguh hix mbouj dwg.",
        "zh": "快也不是，慢也不是。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz bae caemh ndaej.",
        "zh": "你去也成。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ngaenz lai mbouj itdingh baenz.",
        "zh": "钱多未必好。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Saw yawj lai gyaeuj dot.",
        "zh": "书看多了头疼。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou hawj cij ndaej doengh.",
        "zh": "我允许才能动。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Boux neix bouxcuengh.",
        "zh": "这个人是壮族。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De ginsiyanj.",
        "zh": "他是近视眼。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ngoenzcog sam nyied sam.",
        "zh": "明天是三月三。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Boux song aen.",
        "zh": "每人两个。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz baenzlawzyangh?",
        "zh": "你怎么样？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou vunz Gvangjsih.",
        "zh": "我是广西人。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dahnuengx gou goet sang.",
        "zh": "我妹妹是个高个儿的。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De cibbet, gou ngeihcib.",
        "zh": "他十八，我二十。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Bonj saw neix bet maenz ngaenz.",
        "zh": "这本书八块钱。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Duzvaiz gwn nywj.",
        "zh": "牛吃草。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou roxnaj de.",
        "zh": "我认识他。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De rox gangj VahCuengh.",
        "zh": "他会说壮话。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Daeg neix lumj daxboh de.",
        "zh": "这男孩像他爸爸。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De daengz Bwzgingh gvaq.",
        "zh": "他到过北京。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De dwg vunz baihbaek.",
        "zh": "他是北方人。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ngoenzlwenz nit, ngoenzneix haemq raeuj.",
        "zh": "昨天冷，今天较暖和。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aen gva neix diemz raixcaix.",
        "zh": "这个瓜很甜。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ndaw gyausiz seuqsatsat.",
        "zh": "教室里干干净净的。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ndaw ranz nyaed lai.",
        "zh": "屋里太挤。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gwnz congz nyungqnyatnyat.",
        "zh": "床上乱七八糟的。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou bae laj mbanj.",
        "zh": "我去乡下。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Raeuz haeuj gyausiz.",
        "zh": "咱们进教室。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dah de buet ok doumonz.",
        "zh": "那个女孩跑出大门。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Daeg de benz hwnj gwnzlouz.",
        "zh": "那个男孩爬上楼顶。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De ngoenzcog daeuj laeng gou.",
        "zh": "他明天来我家。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gwnz ciengz did go nywj ndeu.",
        "zh": "墙上长一棵草。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Najmbanj vat diuz mieng ndeu.",
        "zh": "村前挖一条水沟。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Laj daiz miz duz ma ndeu.",
        "zh": "桌子下有一只狗。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ndaw rug diemj aen daeng ndeu.",
        "zh": "卧室里点了一盏灯。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gwnz roen law bae aen habbau ndeu.",
        "zh": "在路上丢失了个钱包。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De gyaeu gijmaz.",
        "zh": "她漂亮什么。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz riu gijmaz.",
        "zh": "你笑什么。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Sou hemq gijmaz.",
        "zh": "你们喊什么。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz byaij duh mwngz.",
        "zh": "你走你的。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou bae cam he baez ndeu.",
        "zh": "我去问它一次。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz ciengq he duenh ndeu.",
        "zh": "你唱它一段。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gonj bit neix gonj duh gou.",
        "zh": "这支笔是我的。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou siengj gwn vanj raemx ndeu.",
        "zh": "我想喝一碗水。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou roxnyinh miz di nit.",
        "zh": "我觉得有点儿冷。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De ngvanh baenzlawz guh ndei.",
        "zh": "他想如何做好。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De ngeix guh gijmaz saeh ngoenzlwenz.",
        "zh": "他回忆昨天做了什么事。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou loqraen miz vunz heuh.",
        "zh": "我梦见有人叫。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De daenj diuz buh moqsupsup ndeu.",
        "zh": "她穿件崭新的衣服。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dangqnaj miz go faex youh hung youh sang ndeu.",
        "zh": "前面有棵高大的树。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aen mak henjrwgrwg neix.",
        "zh": "这个熟透了的果子。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou ndaenj haeuj aenranz laepsaengsaeng bae.",
        "zh": "我走进黑漆漆的那个房子。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ndaek vengq fwj mdaemraeuraeu ndeu daj baihdoeng vaij gvaq daeuj.",
        "zh": "一大片黑黑的乌云从东边压过来。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Laeng de miz hek daeuj.",
        "zh": "他家来了客人。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Haeux bi'moq lw lai.",
        "zh": "去年的稻谷剩的多。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Duzroeg gwnz faex heuhgyigyi.",
        "zh": "树上的鸟儿喳喳叫。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Boux lwgnyez neix caeuq gou bae.",
        "zh": "这个孩子和我去。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aen ranz cien neix aen gou.",
        "zh": "这个砖房是我的。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Lwgsawz dumq ndei gwn raixcaix.",
        "zh": "煮的白薯很好吃",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Raeuz roengzrengz doeg saw.",
        "zh": "我们努力地读书。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De ak gwn ak guh.",
        "zh": "他能吃又能干。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De menhmenh benz hwnj louz.",
        "zh": "他慢慢地爬上楼。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz gik byaij roen, couh gaej bae lo.",
        "zh": "你懒得走路，就别去了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz dinghdingh cuengq doxgaiq roengzdaeuj.",
        "zh": "你把东西轻轻地放下来。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De ngamj bae hwnjban.",
        "zh": "他刚去上班。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou ngoenzlwenz daeuj laeng de.",
        "zh": "我昨天来他家。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Duznou caegcaeg riqgvaq henzciengz.",
        "zh": "老鼠悄悄地从墙根跑过。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou yaek hag mwngz ciengq go.",
        "zh": "我要学你唱歌。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz youq ranz yawj saw lwi?",
        "zh": "你在家看书吗？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Raeuz cug go cug go raemj faex.",
        "zh": "我们一棵一棵地砍着树。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De cij gangj coenz vah dog.",
        "zh": "他只说了一句话。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou daj ndaw dou yawj okbae.",
        "zh": "我从门里往外看。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gangj byoedbyoed byadbyad.",
        "zh": "叽里呱啦地说着。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Byaij ngungxngungx ngangxngangx.",
        "zh": "跌跌撞撞地走着。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gvih gyoedgyoed gyaxgyax.",
        "zh": "小孩跪着玩耍貌。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gwn ndaek gaemz ndaek gaemz.",
        "zh": "大口大口地吃着。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De ninz yawj saw.",
        "zh": "他躺着看书。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Lwgbiek cawj hix baenz gwn.",
        "zh": "芋头煮着也好吃。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Naz hawq lo, raemx dwk lai di.",
        "zh": "水田干了，要多灌溉一些水。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ngah noh lo, noh heh lai di.",
        "zh": "谗肉了，肉要多切点儿。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De ndwen bae haw cawx byaek song baez.",
        "zh": "他每月到集市上买两回菜。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De baez raemj go faex ndeu.",
        "zh": "他每次砍一棵树。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz ndauj haeux ywnz bae.",
        "zh": "你把米拌均匀了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De dub aenvanj ywngz lo.",
        "zh": "他把碗打碎了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Yumz gaiqbaengz hoengz lo.",
        "zh": "把布染红了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Lot faexndoek soemsoem bae.",
        "zh": "把竹子削得尖尖的。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De sij cihsa wloek lo.",
        "zh": "他把字写错了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Duz ma neix yak ya wj yaek dai.",
        "zh": "这只狗难看死了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou nit dwk yaek dai.",
        "zh": "我冻得要死了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz gangj yaek ci ngcuj.",
        "zh": "你要讲清楚。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou hozhawq dwk yaek dai ngoz lo.",
        "zh": "我渴得快要枯死了",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Duz ma de deng vunz dub dwk yaek gyad lo.",
        "zh": "那只狗被人打得快要残废了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz aeu aendaengq daeuj.",
        "zh": "你把凳子拿来。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou soengq gonj bit bae.",
        "zh": "我送一支笔去。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De ngoenzl wenz gei q haujlai ngaenz ma.",
        "zh": "他昨天寄了很多钱回来。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De daxbaenh bae aeu noegcae ndaw reih dauq.",
        "zh": "他刚才去把地里的犁头拿回来。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou yawj hwzbanj ndaej raen.",
        "zh": "我能看得见黑板。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Bien faenzcieng neix sij ndaej liux.",
        "zh": "这篇文章能写完。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De saet ndaej gvaq gumz.",
        "zh": "他能跳过这坑儿。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou di ngq ndaej rox.",
        "zh": "我能听懂。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Duzbit saez ndaej dawz bya.",
        "zh": "鸭子能抓到鱼。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou nit dwk saenzdwddwd.",
        "zh": "我冷得发抖。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De ndwn dwk hwet naet.",
        "zh": "我站得腰累了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou hwngq dwk ok hanh.",
        "zh": "我热得出了汗。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De manh dwk raemxda ri h.",
        "zh": "她被辣得流了眼泪。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De gwn dwk bak youzyubyub.",
        "zh": "他吃得满嘴流油。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou dungx iek dwk dungx doxnemlo.",
        "zh": "我饿得肚子都贴到一起了。、",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz deq gou yaep ndeu.",
        "zh": "你等我一会儿。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De youq Bwzgi ngh sa m bi.",
        "zh": "他在北京住了三年。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aenbiuj mwngz byaij nguh song faenhcung.",
        "zh": "你的表走慢了两分钟。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou ngoenzl wenz ya wj denyi ngj baenzngoenz.",
        "zh": "我昨天看了一天的电影。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De guhcaeg deng gyaeng baengz cib ndawen.",
        "zh": "他因盗窃被关了整整十个月。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou doeg bonj saw neix song baez.",
        "zh": "我读了两次这本书。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou yawj boux de mbat ndeu.",
        "zh": "我看了那个人一眼。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Raeuz raen naj gvaq geij mbat.",
        "zh": "我们见过几次面。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou nga mq cawx song gaen noh.",
        "zh": "我只买两斤肉。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Diuzvaq neix raez conq ndeu.",
        "zh": "这条裤子长了一寸。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De deng daxboh dub angjfwngz song baez.",
        "zh": "他被父亲打了两下手心。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aen louz neix sang gvaq aenhaenx song boix.",
        "zh": "这栋楼比那栋楼高两倍。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ca wx gij byaek neix cienh haujlai ngaenz.",
        "zh": "买这些菜便宜了很多钱。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Duzroeg mbi n dwk byux.",
        "zh": "鸟儿“扑”地一声飞了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De hup aendou dwk gumx.",
        "zh": "他“乓”地一声关上门。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gofaex raek dwk hat.",
        "zh": "树“哒”地一声断了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De ae dwk gvemz.",
        "zh": "他咳嗽了一声。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou haengj nin ai.",
        "zh": "我喜欢仰着睡。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cungj byaek neix ndaej gwn ndip.",
        "zh": "这种菜能生吃。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De naengh vang lai.",
        "zh": "他横着坐的多。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De daxbaenh laemx hoemj.",
        "zh": "他刚才跌倒了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De ga mj byaij roen laep ne, gou couh byaij dingqgit.",
        "zh": "你若敢走夜路，我就倒立着走。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Duz gaeql wg neix dai nyungz.",
        "zh": "这只小鸡死于被蚊子叮咬。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Go faexl wg neix dai ndit.",
        "zh": "这棵小树是死于阳光太强。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aen ci de loemq boengz.",
        "zh": "那辆车陷于泥潭。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Duz ma neix ndoq gyak.",
        "zh": "这只狗因癣而掉光了毛。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gyaeng hawj de dai nit bae.",
        "zh": "关着它直到被冻死。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Raeuz dik haeuj aen giuz ndeu.",
        "zh": "我们踢进了一个球。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz rap song doengj raemx.",
        "zh": "你挑两桶水。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De ja wj bonj saw ndeu.",
        "zh": "他看一本书。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou cawx song gaen noh.",
        "zh": "我买两斤肉。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mou iq maj hung.",
        "zh": "小猪长得大。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou di ngq rox.",
        "zh": "我能听得懂。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De doeksaet yat.",
        "zh": "她吓了一跳。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Duzgaeq cak byux.",
        "zh": "鸡“扑”地挣扎了一下。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbouj yungh ca m, gou rox vi hmaz de ndoj gou.",
        "zh": "不用问，我知道为什么她躲着我。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cungj ma gangj, mbouj miz raemx raeuz couh dai.",
        "zh": "总的来说，没有水，我们就会死去。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ci bbi gonq, caemhdwg bi 1993, de bae doeg dayoz.",
        "zh": "十年前，即1993年，他去上大学。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Duz mou neix, gou yawj aiq miz song bak gaen.",
        "zh": "这头猪，我看可能有二百斤。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De mbouj hwnjban, dingqnaeuz de laeuj fiz lo.",
        "zh": "他没上班，听说他醉酒了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz yawj, mwngz ceng di caeuh laemx lo.",
        "zh": "你看，你差点儿就摔倒了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De l umj naeuz mbouj youq ranz.",
        "zh": "他好像不在家。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Duz mou neix noixgangj cungj miz song bak gaen.",
        "zh": "这头猪至少有二百斤重。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz vaiq di gwn, Genmingz.",
        "zh": "你快点吃，建明。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Vei, mwngz heuh coh maz?",
        "zh": "喂，你叫什么名字？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Boh, mwngz seizlawz daeuj laeng gou youq?",
        "zh": "爸，你什么时候来我家住？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz mbouj ndaej yienghneix guh, Lauj Vangz.",
        "zh": "你不能这么做，老王。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aex, mwngz yaepdi bae yawj de guh gij maz.",
        "zh": "嗳，你过一会儿去看看他在做什么。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aexyax, gou lumz fagseiz youq ndaw ranz lo.",
